<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 693 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 693 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 693 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Friday.</p>
<p>Rates and amounts (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID	   AMOUNT	   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    52-weeks	 200	     200		  8.50 pct</p>
<p>    Five years     355	     355		  10.00 pct</p>
<p>    15 years	 138	     138		  10.50 pct</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	    693	    693</p>
<p>Maturity (jouissance) was set for March 4, 1997.</p>
<p>    ($1= 9.3 dirhams)    (- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518)</p>
</text>
